    "reason": "Experiments use commercial GAC, real tap water, and environmentally relevant (~5 ng/L) concentrations in batch mode; endpoints are relative sorption/removal trends for defined precursor species, making results broadly comparable to other adsorption studies under similar low ng/L, drinking-water conditions, though they are more qualitative than quantitative.",
